OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 2 MAR
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GMusic by Britten and Bridge
OL,6,     Gperformed live by one of Radio
OL,7,     G3's New Generation Artists, and
OL,8,     Galso this week, exclusive concert
OL,9,     Grecordings of distinctive
OL,10,     Gsettings of the church mass.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Sibelius
OL,12,     GKate Molleson charts the
OL,13,     Ginfluences upon the early
OL,14,     Gsymphonies of Sibelius, including
OL,15,     Gthe romantic symphonic music of
OL,16,     GTchaikovsky, and themes of
OL,17,     GNationalism.
